{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょんっひなぴょんっ(*´-ω-)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメントありがとうっ！\nやっぱり元気もらえるよ☆彡\nありがとうっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回は137でした\n豊富→抱負でした\n気づかなかったです(><)\n教えてくれてありがとうございます☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ触角ない川後ですっ☆彡初だねっ\nちょっとやってみたよ！\nいつもと違うかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は何しましたか??!(・c_,・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜はね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡の天神コアに行ってきたよっ！☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ見てきたよっ**"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別の服とかねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いのいっぱいあったよω"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、この前"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウステンボスに行ったよ♪。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"光の王国"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イルミネーション凄かったよ(ノω<`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超絶きらきらやった!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おすすめやけん、長崎行く機会あったら行ってみてね(´∀｀。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎では、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族とお出かけしたり\nおばあちゃんにあって\n友達がお家に集まってくれて\n親戚にあって、可愛いいとこにあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡では、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おじいちゃん・おばあちゃんのとこに泊まりに行って\n親戚にあって、生まれたばかりの赤ちゃんをみて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月満喫しちゃったよ(。・ω・。)ノいえいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった　!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなめろさんは、お正月何したのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大晦日といえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎年越し蕎麦\n◎除夜の鐘\n◎紅白\n◎ガキ使"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って多かったね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年越し蕎麦は食べたよっ\n紅白歌合戦とガキ使は交互にみてたよっ☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして0時ぴったりにジャンプしたよっ(｀・ω・)っ彡/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンプした人いるかな？\nひなめろさんは、年越したとき何かしましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問答えてくれてありがとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の抱負は、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん良い抱負だなっ(/ω＼*)\n陽菜も抱負のなかにいれたいなって思うのも沢山あったな☆彡参考になる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験合格とか多かったかな?応援してるよっ(o>ω<o)!!\n陽菜に会いに行くって人も案外多かったかな?嬉しい(；▽；)待ってるよっ☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテール革命!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんちゃんと☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5日の全国握手会は、まいやんちゃんとなんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第1レーンでまってます☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん推しの方よろしくおねがいします(。-人-。)\nひなめろさん待ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他メン推しの方でも遊びに来てね☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの家のお雑煮のお餅は、\n丸○？四角□？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えてほしいなっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまがとってくれたんだけどね、\n加工したらね神秘的になったのよ笑。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じじ出てるねっ(」・ω・)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/01/03/2314366/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴょんっ"}],"source":"archive"}